{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Fase 4 - Feedback API",
    "description": "Collection for testing the Feedback API with REST endpoints for creating and managing feedback.\n\nTwo environments:\n- local: LocalStack on http://localhost:4566/avaliacao\n- prod: AWS API Gateway on https://x250lwug12.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod/avaliacao\n\nVariables (baseUrl, localUrl, prodUrl, timestamp, feedbackId) are embedded in the collection.\n\nFluxo: primeiro execute 'Selecionar ambiente local' (ou 'prod'), depois os testes de 'Criar Avaliação'.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-set timestamp before each request for unique test data",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', Date.now());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
